    {
      "source_id": "PUB-MOE-2024",
      "title": "高等学校实验室安全分级分类管理办法（试行）",
      "manifest_url": "http://www.moe.gov.cn/srcsite/A16/s7062/202404/t20240419_1126415.html",
      "acquisitions": [
        {
          "local_archive": ".runtime/public-source-research/moe-2024.json",
          "sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
          "artifact_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
          "actual_sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
          "hash_matches_manifest": true,
          "text_extraction_method": "Saved rendered markdown; whitespace removed; no raw HTTP bytes inferred"
        }
      ],
      "excerpt_path": "excerpts/PUB-MOE-2024.txt",
      "excerpt_sha256": "f38c919e800632facc8fd3b15389a360a2b69b325b59ff9179eabb8d279feb09",
      "excerpt_hash_matches_manifest": true,
      "passages": [
        {
          "locator": "L1",
          "source_locator": "第二条",
          "quote": "第二条 本办法中的实验室，是指隶属于高校从事教学、科研等实验、实训活动的场所及其所属设施，以房间为管理单元。中试性质和工业化放大性质的试验场所及其所属设施不在本办法管理范围内，高校如涉及相关场所应根据相关法律法规及标准规范制定相关管理办法。",
          "quote_sha256": "08248f67b70183bc72f7101c9ba72305ae78f012f1c598616c60cabbd7d8b46e",
          "matched": true,
          "primary_comparison_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
          "comparisons": [
            {
              "local_archive": ".runtime/public-source-research/moe-2024.json",
              "artifact_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
              "archive_sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
              "matched": true,
              "occurrences": 1,
              "normalized_quote_characters": 119,
              "normalization": "whitespace_removed",
              "normalized_start": 779,
              "normalized_end": 898,
              "location_units": [
                {
                  "saved_text_line": 22
                }
              ],
              "matched_quote_sha256": "556d03d69b56574e86fba9ac7fe047bed3504f93e31c1830f1af91d15bbda871"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "locator": "L2",
          "source_locator": "第十一条",
          "quote": "第十一条 实验室的用途如研究内容、危险源类型与数量等因素发生变化时，实验室应立即重新进行危险源辨识和安全风险评价，重新判定实验室安全类别及级别，如需变更应立即报告所属二级单位。二级单位应及时修正本单位实验室安全分级分类管理台账，同时报学校备案。高校应及时更新本校实验室安全分级分类管理台账，并定期对实验室分级分类情况进行复核。",
          "quote_sha256": "44055c7eb2fa803092f3ad902e4608a9ea466692e357597b7dad2cdd8fd59f90",
          "matched": true,
          "primary_comparison_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
          "comparisons": [
            {
              "local_archive": ".runtime/public-source-research/moe-2024.json",
              "artifact_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
              "archive_sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
              "matched": true,
              "occurrences": 1,
              "normalized_quote_characters": 162,
              "normalization": "whitespace_removed",
              "normalized_start": 1809,
              "normalized_end": 1971,
              "location_units": [
                {
                  "saved_text_line": 33
                }
              ],
              "matched_quote_sha256": "ba44b95094e0e684e7d3db31395d60beb0167e6a5209f0829a9b3badb14e1f78"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "locator": "L3",
          "source_locator": "第十五条",
          "quote": "第十五条 学校党政主要负责人、学校实验室安全主管职能部门、二级单位、实验室等各级责任机构应根据学校、二级单位和本实验室实际情况，分级开展相应的安全检查工作。在重大隐患未完成整改前，不得在实验室中进行实验活动。",
          "quote_sha256": "a07c7e62d624dc244718875dc7f675bf1f4d8d997cc9739ce9af214b3da30ad9",
          "matched": true,
          "primary_comparison_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
          "comparisons": [
            {
              "local_archive": ".runtime/public-source-research/moe-2024.json",
              "artifact_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
              "archive_sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
              "matched": true,
              "occurrences": 1,
              "normalized_quote_characters": 103,
              "normalization": "whitespace_removed",
              "normalized_start": 2223,
              "normalized_end": 2326,
              "location_units": [
                {
                  "saved_text_line": 38
                }
              ],
              "matched_quote_sha256": "28003e1f9466292e0d0e84cf95c4abd6c249e95c3f133a7bca0cd7c83fd1f62e"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "locator": "L4",
          "source_locator": "第十六条",
          "quote": "第十六条 实验室负责人、实验室安全管理员和实验人员等应根据所在实验室类别和安全等级，接受相应等级的安全培训并开展相应的应急演练。",
          "quote_sha256": "9e39ed5aa253e3aa5dfdaf90a93d8337113eb825a311b98ebc771e5c37aca7f1",
          "matched": true,
          "primary_comparison_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
          "comparisons": [
            {
              "local_archive": ".runtime/public-source-research/moe-2024.json",
              "artifact_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
              "archive_sha256": "265f2d6ef4987298cdfb82a7a57096fcadff111eb9f90f660563ec6475500d4f",
              "matched": true,
              "occurrences": 1,
              "normalized_quote_characters": 63,
              "normalization": "whitespace_removed",
              "normalized_start": 2326,
              "normalized_end": 2389,
              "location_units": [
                {
                  "saved_text_line": 39
                }
              ],
              "matched_quote_sha256": "547f67c74073bb0cbc238823da67c7b39617c1b5532303a2ef3dee407b264c77"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "locator": "L5",
          "source_locator": "第十七条",
          "quote": "第十七条 在实验室开展的科研项目、学生课题，或其他实验活动应进行相应等级的安全风险评估。涉及重要危险源的实验活动，二级单位应进行审查、备案，学校应不定期抽查。Ⅰ级/红色级、Ⅱ级/橙色级实验室应针对重要危险源制定相应的管理办法和应急管控措施，责任到人。",
          "quote_sha256": "1dc8a89061c0f469978f48135be9c9dc96b5b85bbcce095a7814f9a347dfe93d",
          "matched": true,
          "primary_comparison_kind": "browser_act_rendered_markdown",
